The '''Ghost of Game Agent''' is an [[NPC]] that only appears as a {{Legendary}} [[Garden Visitor]] on {{zone|The Garden}}. They require {{Skill|Garden|11}} unlocked to visit, as well as visiting [[Jerry's Workshop]] at least once. '''Ghost of Game Agent''' only visits during the [[Spooky Festival]].

